      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且有股让人摸不着头脑的力量\n正从那扭洞里溢出。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
