      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "567C5E15FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噗胡胡。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "565780E180E130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你去调查之后，我在这期间\n调查了一下胡帕和惩戒之壶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053BB8C0367E54E4B540EFF0C621157288FD9671F95F4000A8C0367E54E864E004E0B80E15E15548C60E962124E4B58F6300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你去调查之后，我在这期间\n调查了一下胡帕和惩戒之壶！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6053BB8C0367E54E4B540EFF0C621157288FD9671F95F4000A8C0367E54E864E004E0B80E15E15548C60E962124E4B58F6FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很久以前胡帕四处大闹，\n惩戒之壶是个用来<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n将胡帕的力量封入其中的壶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F884E454EE5524D80E15E1556DB5904592795F9FF0C000A60E962124E4B58F6662F4E2A7528676500100001BE00000A5C0680E15E157684529B91CF5C01516551764E2D768458F6300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很久以前胡帕四处大闹，\n惩戒之壶是个用来<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n将胡帕的力量封入其中的壶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F884E454EE5524D80E15E1556DB5904592795F9FF0C000A60E962124E4B58F6662F4E2A7528676500100001BE00000A5C0680E15E157684529B91CF5C01516551764E2D768458F6300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你在异次元对战的是\n被封印之前的胡帕……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是解放胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6057285F026B2151435BF962187684662F000A88AB5C0153704E4B524D768480E15E152026202600100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F89E3653E80E15E15300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你在异次元对战的是\n被封印之前的胡帕……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是解放胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6057285F026B2151435BF962187684662F000A88AB5C0153704E4B524D768480E15E152026202600100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F89E3653E80E15E15300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说我的胡帕是\n惩戒胡帕。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF46211768480E15E15662F000A60E9621280E15E15300200100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "更厉害的是，\n只要使用惩戒之壶……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就能让惩戒胡帕\n变成解放胡帕！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66F453895BB37684662FFF0C000A53EA89814F7F752860E962124E4B58F62026202600100001BE01000A5C3180FD8BA960E9621280E15E15000A53D8621089E3653E80E15E15FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "更厉害的是，\n只要使用惩戒之壶……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就能让惩戒胡帕\n变成解放胡帕！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66F453895BB37684662FFF0C000A53EA89814F7F752860E962124E4B58F62026202600100001BE01000A5C3180FD8BA960E9621280E15E15000A53D8621089E3653E80E15E15FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，安馨儿的胡帕\n好像很抗拒惩戒之壶，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不会变化形态啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C5B8999A8513F768480E15E15000A597D50CF5F88629762D260E962124E4B58F6FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D4F1A53D853165F626001554A300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，安馨儿的胡帕\n好像很抗拒惩戒之壶，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不会变化形态啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C5B8999A8513F768480E15E15000A597D50CF5F88629762D260E962124E4B58F6FF0C00100001BE00000A4E0D4F1A53D853165F626001554A300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
